# CASM Phase 12 WP68 Increment 9 trusted reference: casmarith3
#
# Independently hand-assembled from the casmarith3 fixture source in
# cmake/GenerateCasmTestFixtures.cmake. NOT produced by CASM. Proves the
# remaining WP68 operators not yet exercised through the real production
# pipeline by Increment 7's representative sample (*, &, <<, unary -):
# / (division), ^ (XOR), | (OR), >> (right shift), across immediate,
# .BYTE, and .WORD operand contexts. Per-operator numeric correctness
# across the full inventory is already closed by
# tests/src/casm_expr/casm_expr.s's own 97-case harness (expr.s:640-731
# confirms staticDiv/staticXor/'|'-branch/staticShiftRight implement plain
# unsigned division, EOR, ORA, and a zero-filling logical right shift
# respectively -- traced during this increment's own Atomic Step 1 audit).
#
# Source (.ORG $C000, fixed address -- no relocatable symbols involved):
#   LDA #10/2            ; 10/2 = 5
#   LDA #$0F^$03         ; $0F ^ $03 = $0C
#   LDA #$0F|$03         ; $0F | $03 = $0F
#   .BYTE 10/2, $0F^$03  ; 5, $0C
#   .WORD $0F|$03, $8001>>1  ; $000F, $4000
#
# $8001>>1 is a logical (zero-filling) right shift, not arithmetic:
# 1000000000000001 >> 1 = 0100000000000000 = $4000 -- proves the shift
# does not sign-extend, through the real pipeline (the synthetic harness's
# own sShr case already proved this arithmetically; this is its
# production-pipeline counterpart).
#
# All three LDA forms are immediate addressing ($A9, always 2 bytes) --
# immediate mode has no zero-page/absolute width choice, so FORCE_ABS
# classification does not affect them (that proof is casmarithfwd's own
# job, WP68 Increment 7).
#
# Hand assembly:
#   00 C0              PRG load-address header ($C000, little-endian)
#   A9 05              LDA #$05        (10/2)
#   A9 0C              LDA #$0C        ($0F^$03)
#   A9 0F              LDA #$0F        ($0F|$03)
#   05 0C              .BYTE 5, 12
#   0F 00 00 40        .WORD $000F, $4000
#
# bytes: 14
# sha256: aaef9bfd7a6d0128750122114741663f49996536f18614dbcf27b2cb6492076f
# source_sha256: casmarith3.seq=2209dbc65594d774202799ad022da25da6b824dcb0317d4375e676e2ffa10884

00 C0
A9 05
A9 0C
A9 0F
05 0C
0F 00 00 40
